From: dsv41-moe-offload <soc.yuan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 10:32:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] [feat](kt-kernel): let the host framework inject the
 graph-capture probe

_wait_device skipped its device synchronize under capture only via
torch.npu.is_current_stream_capturing() and sglang's global flag. A host
other than sglang (vLLM-Ascend) never sets that flag, so the sync could hit a
captured stream (107027/107030). set_capture_probe(fn) installs the host's
probe (KTMoEWrapper.set_capture_probe forwards to it); None keeps the sglang
default. An installed probe's exceptions propagate instead of reading as
'not capturing'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J2WSYMgzkciGYida1FxV2o
